{
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:36.0pt&quot;&gt;The proposed first floor side\r\nextension, in conjunction with the existing gable end, would result in\r\ndiscordant and ungainly cumulative addition to the dwelling and would fail to\r\nmeet the high quality design aspirations of the National Planning Policy\r\nFramework (2024), and is contrary to Policy D3.D (1) and (11) of the London\r\nPlan (2021), Core Strategy Policy CSB (2012), Policy DM1 of the Harrow\r\nDevelopment Management Policies Local Plan (2013) and the adopted Harrow\r\nSupplementary Planning Document Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed development is located within surface water flood zone 3a and 3b in the absence of a satisfactory Flood Risk Assessment, it has not been demonstrated that the proposed development would not exacerbate the risk of flooding within the site or increase the risk and consequences of flooding elsewhere, contrary to National Planning Policy Framework (2023), Policy SI 12 of The London Plan (2021), Core Policy CS1.U of the Harrow Core Strategy (2012) and Policies DM9 and DM10 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013).&lt;/p&gt;"
